+/**
+ * The primary key encrypts all NEW ciphertext. A dedicated
+ * ACCOUNT_CREDENTIAL_SECRET is the only supported strong setup; falling back
+ * to AUTH_TOKEN is tolerated (single-operator deployments) but the hardcoded
+ * public default must never be treated as real encryption.
